metimes you favor the baddies because it\u2019s fun. Many levels will require you to let some humans die \u2013 pay close attention and don\u2019t get attached.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.poster.avif?t=1772290284\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.webm?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.mp4?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>MAGIC CARDS<br>Every card has a unique effect which can only be used once: turn your hand into a hammer, put out fires with an ice spray, or even spawn in some aliens! But do it quick and get another card right away, or you\u2019ll run out of options!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/3ba74f11525610dbcb44b3de481b70e4.poster.avif?t=1772290284\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/3ba74f11525610dbcb44b3de481b70e4.webm?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/3ba74f11525610dbcb44b3de481b70e4.mp4?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/aab77037670c131c63627ca719ac766f.poster.avif?t=1772290284\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/aab77037670c131c63627ca719ac766f.webm?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/aab77037670c131c63627ca719ac766f.mp4?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>ADAPT TO DIFFERENT CARDS AND SITUATIONS<br>It\u2019s an epic battle with many souls on the line \u2013 and you have to play the hand you\u2019re dealt! Think carefully about the layout of each level and exactly which cards to play or you\u2019ll fail.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/7796f6c286039edefe10858badaca5e8.poster.avif?t=1772290284\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/7796f6c286039edefe10858badaca5e8.webm?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/7796f6c286039edefe10858badaca5e8.mp4?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>CO-OP CROSS-PLAY<br>Cards of Destiny supports cross-play multiplayer! With unique puzzles that call for you and your friend to be in total sync, test your co-op skills and play together on Steam, Quest, Pico or PSVR2!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/9b88d901737b6f1eb51af3f68eb89540.poster.avif?t=1772290284\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/9b88d901737b6f1eb51af3f68eb89540.webm?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/9b88d901737b6f1eb51af3f68eb89540.mp4?t=1772290284\" type=\"video/mp4\"><